<title>USA: North American Mortgage unit to buy Lomas.</title>
<headline>North American Mortgage unit to buy Lomas.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ROSA, Calif. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>North American Mortgage Co said Wednesday its insurance unit, North American Mortgage Insurance Services, has signed a definitive agreement to acquire the operating assets of Lomas Insurance Services.</p>
<p>Financial terms were undisclosed.</p>
<p>The agreement is subject to customary closing conditions and court approval because Lomas's parent company is in bankruptcy, North American Mortgage said.</p>
<p>Lomas Insurance Services sells personal lines insurance products and services over 50,000 policies for more than 40,000 customers throughout the United States.</p>
</text>
